    <string name="settings_follow_sharing">Follow %1$s\'s live location with AshGo closed</string>
    <string name="settings_follow_sharing_body">During their trips AshGo always keeps running. Outside trips, this keeps it running only while they share live. Otherwise, clearing AshGo closes it fully, and alerts reach you when you open it.</string>
